          {
            "title": "Intro 1",
            "id": 126768,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Software yang hebat tidak hanya menentukan apa yang harus dilakukan saat suatu kondisi bernilai <code>true</code>, tetapi juga memiliki rencana cadangan jika kondisi tersebut bernilai <code>false</code>.</p><webview version=\"2\" visible-if=\"always\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   img {&#xA;    height: 300px;&#xA;    width: 200px;&#xA;    border: 1px;&#xA;    border-radius: 10px;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   div {&#xA;    margin: auto;&#xA;    width: 50%;&#xA;    background-color: black;&#xA;    height: 300px;&#xA;    width: 200px;&#xA;    border: 1px;&#xA;    border-radius: 10px;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   button {&#xA;    width: 200px;&#xA;    height: 30px;&#xA;    font-size: 20px;&#xA;    border-radius: 5px;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;    display: block;&#xA;    background-color: #7a88ba;&#xA;    color: white;&#xA;    touch-action: manipulation;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div id=&quot;imgDiv&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;  &lt;button onClick=&quot;toggle()&quot; id=&quot;switch&quot;&gt;isOn == false&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;  &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   let labelOn = &quot;isOn == false&quot;;&#xA;   let labelOff = &quot;isOn == true&quot;;&#xA;   let btn = document.getElementById(&quot;switch&quot;);&#xA;   let imgDiv = document.getElementById(&quot;imgDiv&quot;);&#xA;   let img = document.createElement(&quot;img&quot;);&#xA;   img.src =&#xA;    &quot;https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1537923733628-c28d980ef483?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&amp;ixid=eyJhcHBfaWQiOjEyMDd9&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=2734&amp;q=80&quot;;&#xA;   &#xA;   function toggle() {&#xA;    if (btn.innerHTML == labelOn) {&#xA;     btn.innerHTML = labelOff;&#xA;     imgDiv.appendChild(img);&#xA;    } else {&#xA;     btn.innerHTML = labelOn;&#xA;     imgDiv.removeChild(img);&#xA;    }&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Intro 2",
            "id": 126769,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Seperti aplikasi ini yang menyalakan lampu jika <code>isOn</code> bernilai <code>true</code> dan mematikannya jika <code>isOn</code> bernilai <code>false</code>.</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   img {&#xA;    height: 300px;&#xA;    width: 200px;&#xA;    border: 1px;&#xA;    border-radius: 10px;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   div {&#xA;    margin: auto;&#xA;    width: 50%;&#xA;    background-color: black;&#xA;    height: 300px;&#xA;    width: 200px;&#xA;    border: 1px;&#xA;    border-radius: 10px;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   button {&#xA;    width: 200px;&#xA;    height: 30px;&#xA;    font-size: 20px;&#xA;    border-radius: 5px;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;    display: block;&#xA;    background-color: #7a88ba;&#xA;    color: white;&#xA;    touch-action: manipulation;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div id=&quot;imgDiv&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;  &lt;button onClick=&quot;toggle()&quot; id=&quot;switch&quot;&gt;isOn == false&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;  &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   let labelOn = &quot;isOn == false&quot;;&#xA;   let labelOff = &quot;isOn == true&quot;;&#xA;   let btn = document.getElementById(&quot;switch&quot;);&#xA;   let imgDiv = document.getElementById(&quot;imgDiv&quot;);&#xA;   let img = document.createElement(&quot;img&quot;);&#xA;   img.src =&#xA;    &quot;https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1537923733628-c28d980ef483?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&amp;ixid=eyJhcHBfaWQiOjEyMDd9&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=2734&amp;q=80&quot;;&#xA;   &#xA;   function toggle() {&#xA;    if (btn.innerHTML == labelOn) {&#xA;     btn.innerHTML = labelOff;&#xA;     imgDiv.appendChild(img);&#xA;    } else {&#xA;     btn.innerHTML = labelOn;&#xA;     imgDiv.removeChild(img);&#xA;    }&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Intro 3",
            "id": 126770,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita sudah tahu bahwa pernyataan <code>if</code> membantu kita mengeksekusi kode jika <code>condition</code> tertentu bernilai <code>true</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" condition = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" condition {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"20\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>condition</code>, diikuti oleh <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Intro 4",
            "id": 126771,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mari tambahkan pernyataan <code>if</code> lain yang menggunakan <code>!condition</code> untuk menjalankan kode yang berbeda jika kondisinya <code>false</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" condition = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" condition {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" !condition {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;2&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"63\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>!condition</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Else",
            "id": 126772,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Alih-alih membuat dua pernyataan <code>if</code>, kita menggunakan pernyataan <code>if</code> / <code>else</code> untuk mendapatkan hasil yang sama.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" condition = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" condition {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;2&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>else</code>, diikuti oleh <code>{</code>, dan terakhir <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Else",
            "id": 126773,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Pernyataan <code>else</code> dari pernyataan <code>if</code> / <code>else</code> selalu berada di akhir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" condition = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" condition {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;2&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"or\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>else</code>, diikuti oleh <code>{</code>, dan terakhir <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lights off",
            "id": 126774,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mari kita lihat sebuah kasus penggunaan: jika <code>isDay</code> bernilai <code>true</code>, kita ingin mematikan lampu.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isDay = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isDay {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Lights off!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"16\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Lights off!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>true</code>, diikuti oleh <code>isDay</code>.</p></body></html>"
