          {
            "title": "No own condition",
            "id": 126776,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Pernyataan <code>else</code> tidak memerlukan kondisinya sendiri. Itu karena pernyataan tersebut menangani kasus saat kondisi <code>if</code> bernilai <code>false</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number = \" /><text value=\"99\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number == \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;It's 1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;It's not 1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"else if\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"It's not 1\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>if</code>, diikuti oleh <code>number == 1</code>, dan terakhir <code>else</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
